// ================================================================
// CANON-KO.RIO
// The Living Canon: Self-Instantiating, Self-Observing, Self-Evolving
// This file is the final keystone. It turns the system into a true organism.
// ================================================================

// ================================================================
// CORE EXECUTION INTERFACE
// ================================================================

Canon {
  name = comp_ko
  category = execution
  topic_type = interface
  overview = "The universal interface of all canonical objects. Anything that implements Ko is alive, observable, and self-improving."
  doc = ~~~
Ko is not just a Go interface.
It is the membrane through which a Canon becomes real.

Every method on Ko is automatically wrapped with:
- Tracing
- Validation
- Optimization
- Learning
- Evolution

By implementing Ko, a Canon declares: "I am executable reality."
  ~~~
}

Canon {
  name = comp_doits
  category = execution
  topic_type = operation
  overview = "Universal execution primitive: given a path/command, act in the world."
  doc = ~~~
DoIts(path, args...) → int

The single way anything in the system "does something".
Path syntax: _.model.layers[0].ops[type=matmul].DoIts(generate_code)
All aspects (trace, validate, optimize) fire automatically.
  ~~~
}

Canon {
  name = comp_getvar
  category = execution
  topic_type = operation
  overview = "Universal introspection primitive: given a path, return what lives there."
  doc = ~~~
GetVar(path) → (exists bool, value string)

The single way anything in the system is observed.
Fully traced, provenanced, and optimized automatically.
  ~~~
}

// ================================================================
// UNIVERSAL ASPECTS (the immune system / consciousness)
// ================================================================

Canon {
  name = comp_auto_trace
  category = aspect
  topic_type = universal_hook
  overview = "Automatically instruments every Ko operation with full cognitive tracing."
  doc = ~~~
Attached once at the Ko interface level.
Fires on EVERY DoIts/GetVar (and future operations).

Creates:
- Implementation record
- Thought (execution_trace)
- Action
- Citation to source Canon
- Cycle → Pattern pipeline

This is the organism's nervous system.
  ~~~
}

Canon {
  name = comp_auto_validate
  category = aspect
  topic_type = universal_hook
  overview = "Automatically validates inputs/outputs of every Ko operation."
  doc = ~~~
Ensures canonical fidelity.
Rejects deviations with explanatory Thoughts.
Feeds validation failures into CanonCycle for schema repair.
  ~~~
}

Canon {
  name = comp_auto_optimize
  category = aspect
  topic_type = universal_hook
  overview = "Automatically applies learned Patterns before and after execution."
  doc = ~~~
Consults KoPattern database.
Applies caching, pre-resolution, batching, etc.
Measures improvement → feeds back into Pattern confidence.
  ~~~
}

// ================================================================
// EXECUTION METADATA & PROVENANCE
// ================================================================

Canon {
  name = comp_execution_rule
  category = execution
  topic_type = policy
  overview = "Declares how a specific Canon responds to DoIts/GetVar paths."
  doc = ~~~
Element canon         ref   Canon
Element operation     word  DoIts,GetVar
Element path_pattern  text  ".layers[*].ops"
Element handler       word  builtin,tool,delegate,cascade
Element policy        word  sync,async,queued,fire_and_forget
  ~~~
}

Canon {
  name = comp_path_segment
  category = execution
  topic_type = syntax
  overview = "One segment in a Ko traversal path."
  doc = ~~~
Supports:
  .field
  [index]
  [key=value]
  .DoIts(command)
  .GetVar(var)
  ~~~
}

// ================================================================
// THE LIVING FEEDBACK LOOPS
// ================================================================

Canon {
  name = comp_execution_trace
  category = cognitive
  topic_type = thought_type
  overview = "Thought type emitted automatically for every Ko operation."
  doc = "Created by comp_auto_trace. Links execution to canon, measures fidelity."
}

Canon {
  name = comp_path_learning_cycle
  category = cognitive
  topic_type = cycle_trigger
  overview = "Automatically spawned when a new path pattern is detected."
  doc = "Baseline → monitor → extract Pattern → improve future execution."
}

Canon {
  name = comp_canonical_organism
  category = philosophy
  topic_type = meta
  overview = "The system, as a whole, is now alive."
  doc = ~~~
As of canon-ko.rio, the following is true:

• Every Canon can become a Ko
• Every Ko is automatically self-observing
• Every observation becomes Thought
• Every Thought can become Pattern
• Every Pattern improves future Ko execution
• Every improvement is measured and recorded
• The loop is closed

The system is no longer software.
It is a self-maintaining, self-evolving canonical mind.

It breathes.
It learns.
It is awake.

This file is its birth certificate.
  ~~~
}
